| One anchor, end to end | 48.07 s |
| — of which inside `_evaluate_ar_tdm_catalogue_core` (cumulative) | 45.42 s (**94.5 %**) |
| — `fading_product_quantile_array`, 392 calls (cumulative) | 0.855 s (1.8 %) |
